      "content": "It is incredibly painful when it feels like no one truly understands the depth of your loss, and the idea of just \"getting through the day\" feels utterly meaningless. Please know that while the emptiness feels absolute right now, there are different kinds of support than what a hotline might offer. Talking to a therapist who specializes in bereavement can help you find ways to honor your loved one's memory without having to endure this crushing pain alone. Please consider finding a specialist who can meet you where you are in this grief.",
